            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "beach lover"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This sauce is so good. I used it as a stir fry sauce and instead of putting the cornstarch in the sauce I tossed the chicken in it. Thickened the sauce perfectly. Added veggies and it was a perfect quick dinner.",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-21T17:20:12.610Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
