              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "1"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "silvia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's not supposed to be hoisin sauce! You're supposed to use oyster sauce!!!! \nI'm Chinese and the Chinese name for this dish is literally \"oyster sauce gai lan\". I don't know how I could have missed it when following this recipe but I used the hoisin sauce like it says and it turned out totally different than what it's supposed to taste like. At first I thought it was because it had too much sugar, then I realized it never asked for the key ingredient-oyster sauce!",
            "datePublished": "2015-01-04T12:49:32.433Z"
          },
